<title>USA: Cholestech names Andrea Tiller CFO.</title>
<headline>Cholestech names Andrea Tiller CFO.</headline>
<dateline>HAYWARD, Calif. 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cholestech Corp Tuesday said Andrea Tiller was appointed vice president of finance and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Prior to joining Cholestech, Tiller was director of corporate planning at Target Therapeutics Inc and business planning manager at Bay Networks Inc.</p>
<p>Cholestech officials were not available for comment on the previous CFO.  </p>
<p>A Cholestech spokeswoman later said Tiller succeeds as CFO Richard Janney, who left the company about 2-1/2 months ago to pursue other interests.</p>
</text>
